# Shambling Ghast's Treasure goes to the controller of the ability, who controlled the Ghast as it died (CR 603.3a,
# 603.10a), not to its owner: Bot2 takes Bot1's Ghast with Act of Treason and bolts it, so the Treasure is Bot2's.
# Bot2's own Ornithopter is a creature the first mode could not target, so it is the Treasure mode that is chosen.

